model {
  extend basalt.deployment {
    metadata {
      constraint "Candidate declaration inspection and the real Worker upload use one pure script-settings projection. Inspection runs no plan, apply or state operation. The projection is exported from the existing provider module, so this carry adds no dependency files and works with fresh Bun patch application. The runner probe compares the complete frozen script-settings surface for all 19 production roles before backup, recording only safe read metrics and field deltas. Numeric placement targets resolve only through the exact serving version identities; unknown or conflicting mappings refuse."
    }
  }
}
